OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 18 Nov to Fri 27 NovFA
OL,6,Fchangeable and often rather unsettled
OL,7,Fperiod looks most likely. Further
OL,8,Fareas low pressure will move in from
OL,9,Fthe Atlantic and whilst all parts are
OL,10,Flikely to see some rain at times, it
OL,11,Fis southern areas which may turn out
OL,12,Fto be wettest, relative to average
OL,13,Fconditions, through this period.
OL,14,FStrong winds are also possible from
OL,15,Ftime to time. Incursions of milder air
OL,16,Fare likely towards the south, but it
OL,17,Fcould remain on the cold side overall
OL,18,Ffurther to the north, where there is
OL,19,Fpotential for sharp overnight frosts
OL,20,Fwhere clear skies and light winds
OL,21,Fcombine. By the latter part of this
OL,22,Fperiod, weather patterns in the
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fvicinity of the UK may become rather
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fmore slowly evolving.
